      "en": "DECORATIVE ARTS<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>Any machine, apparatus, tool or process is classified in this class insofar as it produces an effect or mark meant to be judged by the eye and insofar as such machine, apparatus, tool or process is not provided for elsewhere",
